{"seq":3,"slug":"posterior-inference","title":"后验推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/bayesian-data-analysis/foundations/posterior-inference","wordCount":1831,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"后验推断\">后验推断</h1><p>后验分布是贝叶斯分析的唯一产物，但它本身不是结论。没人会在报告里贴一条 47 维的联合后验密度函数。真正进入决策、进入论文、进入仪表盘的，是从后验里提取出来的东西：一个数、一个区间、一条预测曲线。这一篇讲的就是「拿到后验之后怎么把它读成人话」——这是连接抽象推断和实际行动的最后一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>从后验提取信息，本质上都是在求某个关于后验的期望或分位数。设后验为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\theta \\mid D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，常见的提取操作如下表。它们的共同点是几乎都归结为积分，而这些积分在现代实践中通常用<a href=\"../computation/mcmc\">MCMC 采样</a>产生的后验样本来近似——有了一堆 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 的样本，期望就是样本均值，分位数就是样本分位数。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>想要的结论</th>\n<th>数学操作</th>\n<th>用后验样本如何算</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>点估计（后验均值）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\theta \\mid D]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>样本平均</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点估计（后验众数 MAP）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\arg\\max p(\\theta \\mid D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>找密度峰值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不确定性（可信区间）</td>\n<td>满足覆盖 95% 的区间</td>\n<td>样本分位数或最高密度区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>命题概率</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\theta &gt; c \\mid D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>样本中满足条件的比例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关注子集</td>\n<td>边缘化掉其他参数</td>\n<td>只看该参数的样本列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对新数据预测</td>\n<td>后验预测分布</td>\n<td>对每个样本模拟新数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>下图展示从后验出发的几条提取路径，它们都通向可汇报的结论。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    POST[后验 p theta given D] --&gt; S[后验样本集合]&#10;    S --&gt; PE[点估计&lt;br/&gt;均值 中位数 或 MAP]&#10;    S --&gt; CI[可信区间&lt;br/&gt;等尾 或 最高密度]&#10;    S --&gt; PR[命题概率&lt;br/&gt;例如 theta 大于阈值]&#10;    S --&gt; MARG[边缘化&lt;br/&gt;积掉冗余参数]&#10;    S --&gt; PPD[后验预测分布&lt;br/&gt;预测新观测]&#10;    PPD --&gt; CHK[后验预测检查]\">flowchart TD\n    POST[后验 p theta given D] --&gt; S[后验样本集合]\n    S --&gt; PE[点估计&lt;br/&gt;均值 中位数 或 MAP]\n    S --&gt; CI[可信区间&lt;br/&gt;等尾 或 最高密度]\n    S --&gt; PR[命题概率&lt;br/&gt;例如 theta 大于阈值]\n    S --&gt; MARG[边缘化&lt;br/&gt;积掉冗余参数]\n    S --&gt; PPD[后验预测分布&lt;br/&gt;预测新观测]\n    PPD --&gt; CHK[后验预测检查]</pre><h2 id=\"点估计-把分布压成一个数\">点估计：把分布压成一个数</h2><p>当必须给出单个代表值时，后验提供几个选择。后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\theta \\mid D]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是最常用的，它在平方损失下最优；后验中位数在绝对损失下最优且对偏态更稳健；后验众数（MAP，最大后验）则对应密度峰值，与频率派的正则化最大似然估计有形式上的联系。选哪个取决于你的损失函数——这是贝叶斯决策论的视角：点估计不是凭空选的，而是某个损失下期望损失最小的那个值。</p>\n<p>需要强调：把后验压成一个点必然丢掉信息。一个均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 的后验，可能是紧紧集中在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>（很确定），也可能从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 几乎均匀（极不确定）。所以点估计永远应当与下面的区间一起汇报，单独的点估计在贝叶斯语境里几乎总是误导。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可信区间-直接的概率陈述\">可信区间：直接的概率陈述</h2><p>可信区间是贝叶斯不确定性量化的主力。95% 可信区间的含义干净利落：参数有 95% 的概率落在这个区间内。这与频率派置信区间形成鲜明对比——后者的「95%」说的是「区间构造方法在重复抽样下有 95% 概率覆盖真值」，而对手头这一个具体区间不能说参数有 95% 概率在里面。贝叶斯可信区间说的正是大多数人本能以为置信区间在说的那件事。</p>\n<p>构造方式有两种。等尾区间取后验的 2.5% 和 97.5% 分位数，简单且对单调变换稳健。最高密度区间（HDI）取包含 95% 概率质量且密度最高的那段，对偏态或多峰后验更贴切——HDI 内任何点的密度都高于 HDI 外的点。对称后验下两者重合，偏态后验下 HDI 通常更短也更合理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边缘化-只看关心的参数\">边缘化：只看关心的参数</h2><p>现实模型往往有许多参数，但你常常只关心其中一两个。比如回归里你可能只在乎某个系数，而方差、截距、其他系数都是「干扰参数」。贝叶斯处理干扰参数的方式优雅而统一：把它们积分掉。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∣</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∣</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\theta_1 \\mid D) = \\int p(\\theta_1, \\theta_2 \\mid D)\\, d\\theta_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2222em;vertical-align:-0.8622em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这就是边缘化。它的威力在于：边缘后验自动把干扰参数的不确定性传播进了你关心的参数——你不是把干扰参数固定在某个估计值（那会低估不确定性），而是对它的所有可能取值加权平均。用后验样本时边缘化简单到近乎免费：联合后验的样本里，只取你关心那一列，丢掉其余列，剩下的就是边缘后验的样本。这种「自动传播不确定性」的能力是贝叶斯相对插件式估计的一大优势，也是<a href=\"../models/hierarchical-models\">层次模型</a>能正确处理多层不确定性的根基。</p>\n<h2 id=\"后验预测分布-从参数到新数据\">后验预测分布：从参数到新数据</h2><p>科学问题最终常常是关于未来观测而非关于参数本身：下一位顾客会买吗，明天的需求是多少。后验预测分布回答这个，它对参数的后验不确定性做积分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>∣</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>∣</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\tilde{y} \\mid D) = \\int p(\\tilde{y} \\mid \\theta)\\, p(\\theta \\mid D)\\, d\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2222em;vertical-align:-0.8622em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直觉是：先按后验抽一个参数值，再用这个参数模拟一个新观测，重复很多次，得到的新观测集合就是后验预测分布。它比「用点估计参数去预测」更诚实，因为它同时包含两种不确定性——参数不确定性（我们不完全知道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>）和观测噪声（即使知道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>，数据本身也有随机性）。后验预测分布还是模型批判的工具：把模拟出的新数据和真实数据比对，就是后验预测检查，它是<a href=\"../practice/workflow-diagnostics\">工作流与诊断</a>里判断「模型和现实像不像」的核心手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从积分到样本\">从积分到样本</h2><p>上面所有提取操作都依赖积分，而<a href=\"bayesian-thinking\">贝叶斯思维</a>里已经指出，这些积分通常没有解析解。贝叶斯计算的伟大转变在于：我们不去解析地求积分，而是想办法从后验里抽样，然后用样本把积分变成求和。期望变样本均值，区间变样本分位数，概率变样本比例，预测变样本模拟。一旦你有了后验的样本，本篇所有结论都只是几行数组操作。如何得到这些样本，正是<a href=\"../computation/\">计算方法</a>章的全部主题——其中 <a href=\"../computation/mcmc\">MCMC</a> 给出渐近精确的样本，<a href=\"../computation/variational-inference\">变分推断</a>给出快速近似的样本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>后验是唯一产物，但结论是从它提取的：点估计、可信区间、命题概率、边缘后验、后验预测。</li>\n<li>点估计（均值/中位数/MAP）必然丢信息，应始终与区间同时汇报；选哪个由损失函数决定。</li>\n<li>可信区间给出参数的直接概率陈述，这正是置信区间常被误以为在说的东西；HDI 比等尾区间更适合偏态后验。</li>\n<li>边缘化通过积分掉干扰参数，自动把它们的不确定性传播进关心的参数，用样本做几乎免费。</li>\n<li>后验预测分布同时包含参数不确定性与观测噪声，是预测和模型批判（后验预测检查）的基础。</li>\n<li>所有提取都归结为积分，实践中用后验样本近似——如何得到样本见<a href=\"../computation/\">计算方法</a>章。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"后验推断","id":"后验推断"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"点估计：把分布压成一个数","id":"点估计-把分布压成一个数"},{"level":2,"text":"可信区间：直接的概率陈述","id":"可信区间-直接的概率陈述"},{"level":2,"text":"边缘化：只看关心的参数","id":"边缘化-只看关心的参数"},{"level":2,"text":"后验预测分布：从参数到新数据","id":"后验预测分布-从参数到新数据"},{"level":2,"text":"从积分到样本","id":"从积分到样本"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"先验与似然","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/bayesian-data-analysis/foundations/priors-likelihood"},"next":{"title":"MCMC 采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/bayesian-data-analysis/computation/mcmc"}}